---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="A brand identity experiment with ChatGPT" windowTitle="web project" showCloseBtn={true}>
  <div class="projectWindow ">
                    
    <div class="lg-8" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <h2>Branding Design experiment with ChatGPT</h2>
        <p>Using ChatGPT to roleplay as a client to experiment with a new branding.</p>
        <p>With this I can leverage the power of ChatGPT to simulate conversations and interactions between a client and a branding professional. This allows me to explore different scenarios and test various branding strategies without involving actual clients or making real-world commitments.</p>
        <p>By assuming the role of a client, I can immerse myself in the mindset of my target audience and simulate their needs, preferences, and expectations. Through this roleplay exercise, I can engage in dynamic conversations with ChatGPT, exploring different branding ideas, discussing design concepts, evaluating marketing approaches, and even receiving feedback on my proposed branding strategies.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-4 filler"></div>
    
    <div class="lg-8 lg-offset-2" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <h3 class="sub">Design Brief</h3>
        <p><strong>Objective</strong>:<br>Create a brand logo for koshugi that evokes a sense of nostalgia and fun, and appeals to collectors and enthusiasts of trading card games, with a particular focus on Pokemon TCG.</p>
          
        <p><strong>Target Audience</strong>:<br>Collectors and enthusiasts of all ages who value high-quality products and services, and are passionate about trading card games, especially Pokemon TCG.</p>
        <p><strong>Brand Personality</strong>:<br>Playful, bold, memorable, retro, and fun.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Design Guidelines</strong>:</p>
        <ul class="noMarginTop">
          <li><p>Incorporate bold typography with a retro feel that stands out and is easy to read.</p></li>
          <li><p>Use bright colors to catch the eye and create a playful, fun vibe.</p></li>
          <li><p>Consider incorporating vintage graphics or imagery that relates to trading card games or Pokemon TCG in particular.</p></li>
          <li><p>The logo should be versatile enough to be used across various platforms and media, including website, social media, print, and packaging.</p></li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Deliverables</strong>:</p>
        <ul class="noMarginTop">
          <li><p>A vector-based logo in a high-resolution format (e.g. AI, EPS, or SVG).</p></li>
          <li><p>A style guide outlining the color palette, typography, and any other design elements used in the logo.</p></li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/font-colors.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/font-colors.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">Chosen typography and colors for this branding.</h6>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-3" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_logo.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_logo.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">Cube logo with outline</h6>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-3" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_clean.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_clean.svg" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">Simpler and cleaner logo</h6>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-12" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="textbox">
        <h3 class="sub">Mockup of namecard and label</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-3 lg-offset-1" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox ">
        <div class="bitFilter">
          <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_namecard_red.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_namecard_red.webp" alt="">
        </div>
        <div class="bitFilter">
          <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_namecard_yellow.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_namecard_yellow.webp" alt="">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-7" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_namecard_mockup.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_namecard_mockup.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">variation 1: Namecard inspired by vintage appointment/record card.</h6>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_sticker.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_sticker.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">Sticker label</h6>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_namecard2_mockup.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_namecard2_mockup.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">variation 2: Namecard inspired by letter envelope.</h6>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-6 lg-offset-3"  data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img class="lazy" src="../media/small/koshugi_box_sticker_mockup.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/koshugi_box_sticker_mockup.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">Sticker label with outline cube logo.</h6>
    </div>
    
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
